<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  /* Basic styling to mimic document structure */
  body { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; }
  h1, h2 { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0.5em; }
  .form-section { margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .line-item-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .signature-line { margin-top: 50px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div>
    <h1>WIDENER UNIVERSITY</h1>
    <h2>DIRECT DEPOSIT AUTHORIZATION FORM</h2>
    <h3>CHECKING ACCOUNT</h3>

    <div class="form-section">
      <p>I hereby authorize <span data-field="institution.name">{{ institution.name }}</span> to initiate an electronic transaction to my account at the financial institution indicated below. I request that 100% of my NET PAY be deposited to this account. I understand this authorization applies to both credits (deposits) authorized herein and debits (withdrawals) required to correct overpayments previously deposited to which I am not entitled. This authority is to remain in force until Widener University has received written notice of my intention to revise this election and has been given a reasonable opportunity to act on my request.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="form-section">
      <p>In order to establish Direct Deposit, it is necessary to obtain information directly from a voided personal check from your account. Before transmitting this form to the Payroll Office, please print VOID in bold letters on BOTH the signature line of the check and the endorsement section of the reverse side of the check.</p>
      <p>Or complete the following: Bank Name: <span data-field="bank_name">{{ bank_name }}</span></p>
      <p>Bank Routing Number: <span data-field="routing_number">{{ routing_number }}</span></p>
      <p>Bank Account Number: <span data-field="account_number">{{ account_number }}</span></p>
    </div>

    <div class="form-section" style="text-align: center;">
      <p>Please Staple</p>
      <p>Voided Check Here</p>
    </div>

    <div class="form-section">
      <p>NAME:(please print) _________________________________________</p>
      <p>WIDENER ID NUMBER (Located on Campus One ID Card): <span data-field="widener_id">{{ widener_id }}</span> (Not Required if Not Known)</p>
      <p>ADDRESS: _________________________________________</p>
      <p>TELEPHONE NUMBER or WIDENER EXT: _________________________________________</p>
    </div>

    <div class="form-section">
      <p>I understand that I will NOT receive a paper copy of each pay statement but will be able to print and view a copy of my current and also some past payment statements from the Web Advisor.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="signature-line">
      <div>
        Signature _________________________
      </div>
      <div>
        Date _________________________
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>